{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AD","canonical_person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AD","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["qvt_eq1_lcf_AD"],"persons":[{"id":"1dq_vh2_eru_*****AA","label":"張尚柔（梁太祖獻皇后）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"尚柔","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0007"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing-ws2060595","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001","quote":"尚柔","mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0007"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"正名、父母或父系依南史十二固定原句，親屬錨附該卷。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru_*****A","source_assertion_id":"a-liang021-wangfen-family-mother-father","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"原卷明載世數或配偶生子女次序。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing-ws2060595","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001","quote":"梁文獻張皇后諱尚柔，范陽方城人也。父穆之娶文帝從姑而生后。后以宋元嘉中嬪於文帝，生長沙宣武王懿、永陽昭王敷，次生武帝。方孕，忽見庭前昌蒲花，光采非常，驚報，侍者皆云不見。后曰：「常聞見昌蒲花者當富貴。」因取吞之，是月生武帝。將產之夕，后見庭內若有衣冠陪列焉。次生衡陽宣王暢、義興昭長公主令嫕。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0007","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0018"}]}},{"id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_A","label":"蕭順之","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"順之","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-001-wangzhi-royal-context:line014:m0006"]},{"surface":"皇考","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-002-wangzhi-royal-context:line019:m0002"]},{"surface":"文皇帝","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-002-wangzhi-royal-context:line019:m0005"]},{"surface":"太祖","mention_ids":